   "html": "\n<h2 class=\"m-h2\" id=\"s-21-1\">Familijna is free</h2>\n<p class=\"m-p\">Familijna is free and will stay free. Every feature described in this help is available to everyone at no cost — on a guest account and on a registered account alike. There are no paid versions and no features reserved for a few.</p>\n<h2 class=\"m-h2\" id=\"s-21-2\">Buy me a coffee</h2>\n<p class=\"m-p\">If you enjoy using Familijna and would like to support its further development, you can buy the creator a coffee. You will find the cup <span class=\"m-control\"><i data-icon=\"coffee\"></i>Buy me a coffee</span> in the footer of the service pages, next to the <span class=\"m-control\">Contact</span> button (an icon only — the name shows in a tooltip).</p>\n<ol class=\"m-ol\"><li>Click the cup. The &quot;Buy me a coffee&quot; window with a short explanation opens (on a phone, from the bottom).</li><li>Choose a coffee: <strong>Small coffee</strong> (5 zł), <strong>Medium coffee</strong> (15 zł) or <strong>Large coffee</strong> (25 zł).</li><li>Click <span class=\"m-control\"><i data-icon=\"check\"></i>Buy a coffee</span> (or <span class=\"m-control\"><i data-icon=\"close\"></i>Cancel</span>). The external service <code class=\"m-code\">buycoffee.to</code> opens in a new tab with that coffee selected, where you choose the payment method.</li></ol>\n<div class=\"m-note m-warn\"><div class=\"m-box-title\"><i data-icon=\"warning\"></i>Note</div><p class=\"m-p\">Support is voluntary and gives no extra features or benefits in the service — it is simply a thank-you. You can send feedback and ideas through the contact form <a class=\"m-ref\" href=\"?ch=19#s-19-6\"><i data-icon=\"arrow-right\"></i>Contacting support</a>.</p></div>",
